<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    <ui:VisualElement name="overlay" class="overlay">
        <ui:VisualElement name="popup" class="card" style="width: 90%; max-width: 600px; padding: 40px; align-items: center;">
            
            <!-- 1. MAIN CHOICE CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="main-choice-container" style="width: 100%; display: flex;">
                <ui:Label text="CHÀO MỪNG" style="font-size: 60px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #461A42; margin-bottom: 50px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />
                <ui:Button name="goto-login-btn" text="ĐĂNG NHẬP" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; height: 110px; font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 25px;" />
                <ui:Button name="goto-register-btn" text="ĐĂNG KÝ" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; height: 110px; font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 25px;" />
                <ui:Button name="goto-guest-btn" text="CHƠI KHÁCH" class="btn" style="width: 100%; height: 90px; font-size: 36px; background-color: rgb(142, 68, 173); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-width: 0;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- 2. LOGIN CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="login-container" style="width: 100%; display: none;">
                <ui:Label text="ĐĂNG NHẬP" style="font-size: 60px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #461A42; margin-bottom: 40px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />
                
                <ui:Label text="Email" style="font-size: 30px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="login-email" style="font-size: 38px; width: 100%; height: 90px; margin-bottom: 25px;" />
                
                <ui:Label text="Mật khẩu" style="font-size: 30px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 10px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="login-password" password="true" style="font-size: 38px; width: 100%; height: 90px; margin-bottom: 35px;" />
                
                <ui:Button name="login-confirm-btn" text="XÁC NHẬN" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; height: 90px; font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 25px;" />
                <ui:Button name="login-back-btn" text="QUAY LẠI" class="btn" style="width: 100%; height: 80px; font-size: 32px; background-color: transparent; border-width: 0; color: #666;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- 3. REGISTER CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="register-container" style="width: 100%; display: none;">
                <ui:Label text="ĐĂNG KÝ" style="font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #461A42; margin-bottom: 30px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />
                
                <ui:Label text="Tên hiển thị" style="font-size: 24px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 5px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="reg-display-name" style="font-size: 32px; width: 100%; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />

                <ui:Label text="Email" style="font-size: 24px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 5px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="reg-email" style="font-size: 32px; width: 100%; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                
                <ui:Label text="Mật khẩu" style="font-size: 24px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 5px;" />
                <ui:TextField name="reg-password" password="true" style="font-size: 32px; width: 100%; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 30px;" />
                
                <ui:Button name="reg-confirm-btn" text="XÁC NHẬN" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; height: 80px; font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                <ui:Button name="reg-back-btn" text="QUAY LẠI" class="btn" style="width: 100%; height: 70px; font-size: 28px; background-color: transparent; border-width: 0; color: #666;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- 4. GUEST CONTAINER -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="guest-container" style="width: 100%; display: none;">
                <ui:Label text="CHƠI KHÁCH" style="font-size: 48px; -unity-font-style: bold; color: #461A42; margin-bottom: 30px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />
                <ui:Label text="Tên này sẽ hiển thị cho đối thủ thấy." style="font-size: 24px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 30px; -unity-text-align: middle-center;" />
                
                <ui:TextField name="guest-name-field" value="Player_VN" max-length="20" style="font-size: 32px; width: 100%; height: 80px; margin-bottom: 30px;" />
                
                <ui:Button name="guest-confirm-btn" text="BẮT ĐẦU" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; height: 80px; font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                <ui:Button name="guest-back-btn" text="QUAY LẠI" class="btn" style="width: 100%; height: 70px; font-size: 28px; background-color: transparent; border-width: 0; color: #666;" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- ERROR LABEL -->
            <ui:Label name="auth-error" text="" style="font-size: 20px; color: #ff5252; margin-top: 10px; min-height: 30px; -unity-text-align: middle-center; white-space: normal;" />
        </ui:VisualElement>
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
